WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.207
Sanji tun tɛ benna ka ye wagatijan kɔnɔ.

00:00:03.287 --> 00:00:11.426
Dugutigiw tun bɛ o ta bonw sɔgɔnanw mankan kɛ, ka o ta kɔnɔbaraw mankan kɛ ka tɛmɛ o ta dankanw kan.

00:00:11.506 --> 00:00:16.933
Lɔnnikɛbaga tun b'a tuloba ni a sen fitininw bɛɛ kɛ ka dumuni ɲini.

00:00:17.013 --> 00:00:21.535
Hali n'a ye dumuni kɛ ka ban, kɔngɔ tun b'a la tuma bɛɛ.
